sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as Auth server
  participant DB as Database
  U->>B: Enter e-mail & password
  B->>+A: POST /login
  A->>+DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
  DB-->>-A: row (hash, salt)
  alt password matches
    A-->>B: 200 OK + session cookie
  else wrong password
    A-->>B: 401 Unauthorized
    Note over B,A: The UI shows "try again" after 3 failures
  end
  deactivate A
  B-)U: Show dashboard
